/// @defgroup yolo_engine ONNX Runtime engine
/// @brief Model loading, letterboxing, ONNX Runtime session setup and the
/// base postprocessing dispatch used by every task.
///
/// The engine owns preprocessing and inference; each task overrides the
/// postprocess() hook. See yolo_ros::engine::Model.

/// @defgroup yolo_tasks YOLO task pipelines
/// @brief Concrete postprocessors for the detection, segmentation, pose,
/// oriented-bounding-box and classification exports, plus their shared
/// box/keypoint helpers (yolo_ros::yolo::utils).

/// @defgroup yolo_tracking Multi-object tracking
/// @brief Tracker-agnostic interface (yolo_ros::tracking::Tracker) and its
/// ByteTrack implementation, Kalman filter, assignment and IoU utilities.

/// @defgroup yolo_nodes ROS 2 lifecycle nodes
/// @brief The four executables' node classes: inference, tracking, debug
/// visualization and depth-based 3D lifting.

/// @defgroup yolo_3d Depth and 3D lifting
/// @brief Robust depth statistics and 2D to 3D conversion for bounding boxes
/// and pose keypoints, plus rigid-transform helpers.

/// @defgroup yolo_utils Shared utilities
/// @brief Cross-cutting helpers: string lowercasing and the message_filters
/// cross-distro compatibility shim.
